# Where this deployment's sandboxes answer. Copy to `.deploy.env` (gitignored).
#
# Each chain's Worker takes the hostname fakereum-<chainid>.$DEPLOY_DOMAIN as a
# Workers Custom Domain, which Cloudflare provisions a DNS record and a
# certificate for during the deploy. The zone must be on the same Cloudflare
# account as the Worker.
#
# Leave this file out entirely and each Worker is reachable at its workers.dev
# host only — nothing else changes.
DEPLOY_DOMAIN=example.com
